    "body": "Hmm yeah, I'm not sure. Maybe someone from @whatwg/components knows. I vaguely recall a discussion about this before and I'm somewhat surprised it resurfaced.\r\n\r\nThe other thing I wonder about here is when someone dispatches a synthetic event. Do we assume that in that case relatedTarget the concept is not set, even though the relatedTarget attribute can return something controlled by the developer?",
